# CODEOWNERS
#
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners (GitHub users,
# @org/team names, or emails). When a pull request touches a matching file,
# its owners are automatically requested for review.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern takes precedence.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything in the repo
*                               @data-miner00

